pace 1
## SQ-NS-01e | Every Compat nightstand drops its stored sugar on break (after the restart)
> kill @e[type=item]
> setblock 42 -60 10 minecraft:air destroy
sleep 2
> execute positioned 42 -60 10 as @e[type=item,distance=..3] run data get entity @s Item.id
expect "minecraft:sugar"
> kill @e[type=item]
